catflow 0.8
1. Read Index           library.index
2. Embed                BGE-M3; "How many PTO days do new hires get?"
3. Retrieve     (1,2)   top_k=5
4. Gate         (2,3)   Ministral 3B; "Do these chunks answer it? tags:
                        yes, no"; max_visits=3; on_budget=yes
   -> { yes: 6 | no: 5 }
5. Rewrite              Ministral 3B; "Rephrase the question"
   -> 2

6. Template     (3)     "Context:\n{input}\n\nAnswer the question."
7. Answer               Qwen3 8B
8. Save Text            answer.md
